_standard_report_en_group_split", "label": "Group-based 60/20/20 stratified split", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two runs per group share trajectory/payload/friction; keeping groups in one split prevents near-duplicates across train and test."}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_signals_truth_separation", "label": "Observed signals vs ground truth separation (signals/, truth/, manifest.csv)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_direction_weighted_error", "label": "Direction-weighted error feature e_dir_mean = mean(e*tanh(q'_des/0.05))", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Friction always opposes motion so robot lags along motion direction; separates friction from gravity load and acceleration effects. Top RF feature (j1_e_dir_mean)."}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_causal_window_features", "label": "24 causal past-window features (1.0 s window, 0.1 s step)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_random_forest_detector", "label": "Random Forest detector (200 trees, threshold 0.4)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "predict_proba treated as uncalibrated model score; hyperparameters chosen on validation AP=0.927 over 32 configs."}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_tracking_error_baseline", "label": "Baseline: normalised RMS tracking-error threshold", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L85", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "What an engineer would try first; tuned with the same validation procedure and alarm rule for a fair comparison."}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_alarm_persistence_rule", "label": "Alarm persistence rule (8 on / 5 off windows)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L83", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reduces flicker at cost of delay; chosen to max F1 s.t. <=0.5 FA/min; selected value at grid edge, reported not changed."}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_event_based_metrics", "label": "Event-based metrics: false alarms/min, detection delay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L93", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_in_range_test_results", "label": "In-range test results: RF F1 0.82, 32/32 detected vs baseline 16/32", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L106", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_stress_test_results", "label": "Stress results: RF 3.88 FA/min, 15/20 healthy runs with FA", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L115", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "reports_standard_report_en_ood_generalisation_failure", "label": "Out-of-distribution failure: heavy load/speed mistaken for friction", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "reports/standard/report_en.md", "source_location": "L20